# Atheric AI Environment Configuration Template

PORT=5000
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://atheric.id,http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:5173,http://localhost,http://localhost:80
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key_here
